      "content": "idk im just kinda scared to call the doc because they'll probably tell me to come back in for more tests and i dont want to deal with all that. it doesnt really hurt that bad, just feels tight. do u think it's probably just the inflammation from the actual surgery? like i saw online that swelling is super normal after ortho stuff.",
